WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.666
- [Patrick Mahomes:] SICK AIR. IT’S LIKE I THREW YOU UP THERE MYSELF.

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.375
- What’s up, football nerds?

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:08.666
- What’s up, foot—oh wait, is Rodgers already being the competitive bully?

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.750
- Come on, we’re all MVPs here.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.750
- Uh...

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.416
- YOU WANT MINE? I’M ABOUT TO GET ANOTHER. 

00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:15.500
- Russ here is his generation’s Drew Brees. 

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.041
Great player but someone’s always better.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.541
- HEY, RUSS. I MADE US JACKETS.

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:22.083
- Let’s race. Winner gets control of the mountain.

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.958
Loser never comes back.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.083
- What? No.
- Losers just wait until next year, man

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:27.166
- NEXT YEAR?! WHERE?

00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.041
- ON YOUR MARK, GET SET. HUT HUT.

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:34.166
- Come on, Aaron. Remember why you are racing…

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:37.833
F--k the Packers. I’ll prove them wrong by winning them a lot of games. 

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:40.125
- Nice try, but I upgraded my weapons.

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:43.750
- DO YOU GUYS THINK ANALYTICS ENRICHENS SPORT OR CHEAPENS IT?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.666
- [Lamar Jackson:] Russ has the lead, but Rodgers and Brady are keeping up.

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:48.083
- Hey, Lamar, come join the rest of the OK QBs!

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.750
Derek’s doing a poetry reading.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:54.166
- Coach screams, screams, screams, but I dream, dream, dream.

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:56.750
I want to go far, but I’m just another used carr.

00:00:57.041 --> 00:00:58.250
- [Together:] Hard snap, hard snap, hard snap.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.250
- NO. MY BOARD. BUT MY DEFENSE REINFORCED IT.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.125
- We have to support Russ with a strong—

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:06.125
OH, WAIT. THE JETS ARE ON. Haha, look at Gase!

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:08.375
- Yo, I think something’s seriously wrong with your situation.

00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:12.416
- With Old Spice Triple Protection Sweat Defense, I’m unstoppable.

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.416
- Hey, can I try that?

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.041
- Uh, sure.

00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:14.875
- DELAY OF GAME!

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:15.708
HOLDING!

00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:16.625
FACE MASK!

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.000
INTENTIONAL GROUNDING. Oh, I haven’t even broken a sweat!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.416
Everyone, I am SO sorry about this. He’s got Triple Protection.

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.916
- [Lamar:] It looks like it's now a race between Rodgers and Mahomes.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:28.666
- You know I also won MVP once—

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:29.750
- THAT'S NOT HELPING.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.041
- Watch out for me, household name DALVIN COOK.

00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:33.625
- Do you smell what the Dalvin is— 

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:35.250
Oh wait, this is straight-up just a cliff.

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:37.375
- Man, did he not see last year’s episode?

00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:39.708
- IS ANYONE ELSE HAVING TROUBLE WITH THE WIFI?

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:43.500
- I could actually win. Take that, Dad. I mean, Belichick. I mean, Arians. 

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.416
- Yo, what up, man? Wanna see me make something out of nothing?

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:47.458
- That child is going to die.

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:48.458
- I knew you were down there somewhere. 

00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:50.166
- NO. MORE. NEW PEOPLE.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.875
- HEY GUYS, HAVE YOU SEEN ALL THIS SNOW?
IT’S LIKE BUFFALO IN THE SUMMER!

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:55.541
- NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO—

00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:57.541
- Uh-oh. Brady released an avalanche of bad takes.

00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:01.958
- Big Ben deserves MVP.
- Ryan Tannehill though.
- Give it to Alex Smith for what he’s come back from.

00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:04.041
- NO. THIS IS MY YEAR.

00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:05.791
- [Together:] I will win MVP!

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:09.541
- Wow, who woulda thought, me, Josh Allen hanging in with the big boys?!

00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:10.333
- Wait, where’s Mahomes?

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.875
- DID YOU ALL DO A SPLIT-SCREEN WITHOUT ME?!

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.958
- Goodell deserves MVP for putting on a season.

00:02:18.669 --> 00:02:21.208
- And let's thank. Baker for the SNickerdoodles, yeah.

00:02:21.221 --> 00:02:22.500
- They're gluten f--king free, baby.

00:02:22.511 --> 00:02:25.821
- So thoughtful. Later on, Kirk will singus a song.

00:02:25.821 --> 00:02:27.916
- I'm going to scream a Creed song at you all!

00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:29.875
- That sounds delightful.

00:02:30.113 --> 00:02:32.125
- But first, a poem from me.

00:02:32.614 --> 00:02:34.833
I'm a Lion to myself.

